{"id":"ba1abccdb0412836","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-nl.md","title":"Nondeterministic Logarithmic Space","display":"df-nl — Nondeterministic Logarithmic Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-nspace]]"],"display":"df-nl — Nondeterministic Logarithmic Space","label":"28-df-nl","aliases":["28-df-nl"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"54da139362531e67\" href=\"?note=54da139362531e67\" title=\"28-df-nspace\">28-df-nspace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nl — Nondeterministic Logarithmic Space"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-nl"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-nl</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\">\\(\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"54da139362531e67\" href=\"?note=54da139362531e67\" title=\"28-df-nspace\">28-df-nspace</a>，仅计工作带且允许常数因子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NL}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NL}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对数界加上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> 避免空输入的零空间问题；输入带只读且不计入空间，这使小于输入长度的空间界有意义。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义4.5；印刷81页；PDF107页。陈述已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-nspace","status":"resolved","id":"54da139362531e67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nspace","status":"resolved","id":"54da139362531e67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)$ 见 [[28-df-nspace]]，仅计工作带且允许常数因子。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{NSPACE}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NL}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NSPACE}(n\\mapsto\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil).","display":true},{"tex":"2","display":false}],"bytes":725,"backlinks":[{"id":"9ef3c71816085a2a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathbf{NL}$ 见 [[28-df-nl]]；补集相对于全部有限二进制串取。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"基本复杂性类：[[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-np]]、[[28-df-conp]]、[[28-df-l]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-pspace]]、[[28-df-npspace]]、[[28-df-exp]]、[[28-df-nexp]]。"},{"id":"154a2f9980ad7fad","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7aa09fd33f1203a2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8380a071500296f8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PATH}$、$\\mathbf{NL}$、$\\le_m^{\\mathbf L}$ 分别见 [[28-df-path]]、[[28-df-nl]]、[[28-df-logspace-reduction]]。"},{"id":"e244e427679f34a1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["54da139362531e67"]}